  "bio": "Sasha Hain is an exceptionally talented tattoo artist, specializing in 'illustrative and vegan' styles, with a unique ability to convey spectacular storylines on skin canvas. She currently practices her art in Moscow, Russia but will also bring her magic to Paris in August. Her skills extend beyond tattooing as she is also a proficient oil painter, adding depth and vibrancy to her unique take on tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Moscow, Central Federal District, Russia\n\n✦ Tattooing flowers & magical animals since 2014\n📍🇩🇪 Berlin based | Next stops:\n🇫🇮 Tampere - May, bookings open!\n✦ DM me your idea!",
